# RTMP Push Configuration - OBS Destination
#
# Copy this file to rtmp-push.conf and edit with your OBS machine IP
# Example: cp rtmp-push.conf.example rtmp-push.conf
#
# This file is included by nginx.conf and should contain the push directive
# to forward the RTMP stream to your OBS machine.
#
# IMPORTANT: rtmp-push.conf is gitignored for security (contains local IPs)

# Optional forward from nginx listen app to OBS machine
# Replace 192.168.1.100 with your actual OBS machine IP address
# Note: Keep this disabled when OBS pulls directly from /listen.
# Note: This relays the stream with the same stream name.
# push rtmp://192.168.1.100:1935/listen;
